sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant H as Central Harness
    participant M as SwTrackController
    participant W as TrackController (wayside)
    participant V as attached vital code
    participant CTC as CTC Office
    participant TM as Track Model
    loop every tick of the shared clock (fixed dt)
        H->>M: step(dt, inputs)
        M->>M: validate the whole tick, or reject it unchanged
        M->>M: maintenance := a CTC switch command is in effect
        loop each wayside
            M->>W: write this tick's inputs (UC-10, UC-11, UC-12)
            alt its line is not ready
                M->>W: idle(): transmit nothing (UC-18)
            else ready
                M->>W: scan()
                W->>W: OS decode, then the program
                W->>V: scan(inputs + program outputs)
                V-->>W: final OUT_ bits
                W->>W: OS encode
            end
        end
        M->>M: commands (UC-13 to UC-16) and one report per wayside (UC-17)
        M-->>H: TrackControllerOutputs
        H->>TM: switches, signals, crossings, track circuits
        H->>CTC: occupancy, read-back, ready per wayside
    end
